<title>USA: Mobil confirms interest in Bridas.</title>
<headline>Mobil confirms interest in Bridas.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mobil Corp confirmed that it is one of the bidders for a stake in Argentine oil and gas firm Bridas Energy Corp, but declined to comment on whether it was close to a deal as Argentine newspapers reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Mobil is participating in the process to acquire interest in Bridas, but our negotiations are the subject of a confidentiality agreement so we cannot comment further,&quot; said a Mobil spokesman.</p>
<p>Two newspapers, Clarin and La Nacion, said the negotiations in New York would yield an imminent announcement on a stake to be taken by Spain's Repsol.  Clarin reported that an agreement in principle was signed on the weekend. ((-- David Chance New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
